        "name": "VPN setup",
        "html": "<h1 id=\"bkmrk-vpn-setup\">VPN setup</h1>\n<p id=\"bkmrk-install-the-client%2C-\">Install the client, then sign in. See <a href=\"https://docs.example.com/books/help-desk-handbook/page/welcome\">Welcome</a> and the <a href=\"[[bsexport:chapter:16]]\">chapter</a> or the <a href=\"https://docs.example.com/books/help-desk-handbook\">book</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"bkmrk-steps\">Steps</h2>\n<ol id=\"bkmrk-download-install-pic\">\n<li>Download</li>\n<li>Install\n<ul>\n<li>Pick <strong>Full</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Sign in</li>\n</ol>\n<ul id=\"bkmrk-client-installed-sig\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input checked disabled type=\"checkbox\"> Client installed</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled type=\"checkbox\"> Signed in</li>\n</ul>\n<table id=\"bkmrk-setting-value-server\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Setting</th>\n<th align=\"center\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Server</td>\n<td align=\"center\">vpn.example.com</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Port</td>\n<td align=\"center\">443</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<pre id=\"bkmrk-get-vpnconnection\"><code class=\"language-powershell\">Get-VpnConnection\n</code></pre>\n<p class=\"callout warning\" id=\"bkmrk-don%27t-share-your-tok\">Don't share your token.</p>\n<p id=\"bkmrk-\"><img src=\"[[bsexport:image:7]]\" alt=\"VPN client\"></p>\n<p id=\"bkmrk-download-the-vpn-pro\">Download the <a href=\"[[bsexport:attachment:4]]\">VPN profile guide</a> or visit the <a href=\"[[bsexport:attachment:5]]\">vendor</a>.</p>\n<p id=\"bkmrk-%7B%7B%4015%23bkmrk-getting-\">Getting started</p>\n<p id=\"bkmrk-permalink-to-faq.\">Permalink to <a href=\"https://docs.example.com/link/17\">FAQ</a>.</p>\n",
        "markdown": "# VPN setup\n\nInstall the client, then sign in. See [Welcome](https://docs.example.com/books/help-desk-handbook/page/welcome) and the [chapter]([[bsexport:chapter:16]]) or the [book](https://docs.example.com/books/help-desk-handbook).\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Download\n2. Install\n   - Pick **Full**\n3. Sign in\n\n- [x] Client installed\n- [ ] Signed in\n\n| Setting | Value |\n|---|:---:|\n| Server | vpn.example.com |\n| Port | 443 |\n\n```powershell\nGet-VpnConnection\n```\n\n<p class=\"callout warning\">Don't share your token.</p>\n\n![VPN client]([[bsexport:image:7]])\n\nDownload the [VPN profile guide]([[bsexport:attachment:4]]) or visit the [vendor]([[bsexport:attachment:5]]).\n\n{{@15#bkmrk-getting-started}}\n\nPermalink to [FAQ](https://docs.example.com/link/17).",
